  "detail_text": "The purpose of this amendment to IFB 36C24226B0010; Project Number 630A4-22-413 is as follows: To extend the Bid Opening date to March 26, 2026, at 10:00AM(EST) Provide additional documents for this solicitation Provide clear numbering for the amendments issued for this solicitation Due to an administrative error in SAM.gov, please note the updated numbering for amendments to be acknowledged in submitted bids: Amendment 0002Â (dated Jan 12, 2026) is nowÂ Amendment 1 Amendment 0001_1Â (dated Jan 20, 2026) is nowÂ Amendment 2 Amendment 002Â (dated Feb 9, 2026) is nowÂ Amendment 3 Amendment 0003Â (dated Mar 2, 2026) is nowÂ Amendment 4 Amendment 0004Â (dated Mar 20, 2026) is nowÂ Amendment 5 1. In accordance with FAR 14.202-8, the government is authorizing electronic bids on this solicitation. ALL bids shall be emailed to Samantha Chavanga, Contract Specialist, at samantha.chavanga@va.gov and timestamped by 9:30 AM (EST) prior to the bid opening time. The bids shall include copies of a bid bond. The bid opening shall take place on Thursday, March 26, 2026, at 10:00am (EST). No hand-carried or mailed bids will be accepted. 2. The bid opening will take place via Microsoft Teams conference call. To access the conference, please access: Meeting ID: 282 242 751 653 9 Passcode: 59uu3Cv9 ______________________________________ Dial in by phone +1 332-249-0600,,437870538# United States, New York City Find a local number Phone conference ID: 437 870 538# Bids received after 9:30AM (EST) will be rejected. Any exception to the terms and conditions of this Invitation for Bid (IFB) will result in a non-responsive bid. Failure to provide a definitive price will result in a non-responsive bid. Receipt of bids must be in accordance with the terms and conditions of this IFB.",
